  <worksheets>
    <worksheet name='中美两国不同年代电影产量对比旋风图'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>step1:先创建数据桶（连续的变量才可以）
step2:之后创建两个计算字段，例如”是否是中国“，数值是0/1，方便用来做求和，公式如下所示，
’‘’
IF [产地]=&quot;中国&quot; THEN 1 
ELSE 0 
END
‘’‘
step3:拖动字段到对应位置
step4:对左边的x轴进行倒叙
</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Sheet1 (豆瓣电影数据)' name='federated.073pb360tfmttd12l49db17h7xy2' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.073pb360tfmttd12l49db17h7xy2'>
            <column caption='是否是中国' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_326229530300669954]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [产地]=&quot;中国&quot; THEN 1 &#13;&#10;ELSE 0 &#13;&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column caption='是否是美国' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_326229530301472771]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [产地]=&quot;美国&quot; THEN 1 &#13;&#10;ELSE 0 &#13;&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[年代 (数据桶)]' derivation='None' name='[none:年代 (数据桶):ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_326229530300669954]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:Calculation_326229530300669954:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_326229530301472771]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:Calculation_326229530301472771:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column datatype='string' name='[产地]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='年代 (数据桶)' datatype='integer' name='[年代 (数据桶)]' role='dimension' type='ordinal'>
              <calculation class='bin' decimals='1' formula='[年代]' peg='0' size='10' />
            </column>
            <column datatype='integer' name='[年代]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='axis'>
