    <worksheet name='各产地的豆瓣电影评分箱线图'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>step1:评分取平均并且取消聚合度量.因为聚合度量相当于就只有1个值了,我们希望的是每个点位都参与决策
step2:智能推荐改为盒须图（相当于箱线图）
step3:右键图上的箱子后可以进行格式编辑
（备注：IQR=Q3-Q1）
</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Sheet1 (豆瓣电影数据)' name='federated.073pb360tfmttd12l49db17h7xy2' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.073pb360tfmttd12l49db17h7xy2'>
            <column-instance column='[评分]' derivation='Avg' name='[avg:评分:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[产地]' derivation='None' name='[none:产地:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column datatype='string' name='[产地]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column datatype='real' name='[评分]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='false' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='refboxplot'>
            <format attr='palette' id='refline0' value='bp_red' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Circle' />
            <reference-line axis-column='[federated.073pb360tfmttd12l49db17h7xy2].[avg:评分:qk]' boxplot-mark-exclusion='false' boxplot-whisker-type='standard' enable-instant-analytics='true' formula='average' id='refline0' label-type='automatic' probability='95' scope='per-cell' symmetric='false' value-column='[federated.073pb360tfmttd12l49db17h7xy2].[avg:评分:qk]' z-order='1' />
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='size' value='0.25' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
